Package: com.anlai.youtubex
Name: YouTubeX
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: A wide, desktop-style YouTube on CarPlay.
 Turn YouTube into a big-screen experience in your car. YouTubeX gives YouTube
 its tablet layout and keeps it in landscape, so browsing, searching and watching
 on the CarPlay display feels like using YouTube on a laptop.
 .
 Features:
  - Wide multi-column layout with the video and suggestions side by side
  - Landscape on every screen, not just in full-screen video
  - Turns on by itself when YouTube opens on the car display
  - Optional always-on mode for the iPhone screen too
  - Share and menu sheets that work properly in the wide layout
 .
 Set it up in Settings > YouTubeX. Changes apply the next time YouTube opens.
 .
 Compatibility: iOS 15 and later, rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine, palera1n).
Maintainer: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Author: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Icon: file:///var/jb/Library/PreferenceBundles/YouTubeXPrefs.bundle/PackageIcon.png
